{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52234","headline":"颂六十二首 五十九 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚夫贪世利，俗士重虚名。\n三空既难辩，八风恒易倾。\n物我久空性，色心仍自萦。\n盛年爱华好，老死丘墓成。\n居高非虑祸，持满不忧盈。\n名利甘刀害，将非安久祯。\n凡愚苟求利，譬犬见秽精。\n不知祸来至，焉知怨苦声。\n（见同书卷一百十一《利害篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}